{title: Dilbara}
{artist: Sachet Tandon Parampara Pati Patni Aur Woh}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Dilbara [A#]ve,        teri [G#]yan dilba [A#]riyan
Hoya [Cm]door meri,        [A#]jaan te bann [Cm]aa
[Cm]Gal teri meri si Bas,        [A#]reh gyi teri ve
[G#]Maaf karde de mainu,        [A#]Meharbaani teri ve
[Cm]Hunn hath main [A#]jodan,        Tu [G#]gussa [A#]chhad de
Sab [Cm]mann jaawan,        [A#]marzi jo teri [Gm]ve
Mera [Cm]chann taan kho gaya,        Mere [A#]kol te reh gaye ne
[G#]Ambar de taare [G]ne,        [Cm]Dilbara [A#]ve
teri [G#]yan dilba [A#]riyan,        Hoya [Cm]door meri
[A#]jaan te bann [Cm]aa,        [Cm]Jaan banaake jaan he
Kadd [A#]lae jaan waale ne,        [G#]Tere bin me kis kaam da
Socheya [A#]nai marjaane ne,        Mera [Cm]chann taan kho gaya
Mere [A#]kol te reh gaye ne,        [G#]Ambar de taare [G]ne
[Cm]Dilbara [A#]ve,        teri [G#]yan dilba [A#]riyan
Hoya [Cm]door meri,        [A#]jaan te bann [Cm]aa
[Cm]Tere bin meri [A#]jaan ga dil,        [G#]Yaara tainu samajh na [Cm]aave
Ho [Cm]judayi [A#]teri,        [G#]Zehar de wargi
[A#]Meri rooh vi mardi [Cm]jaave
